@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP ProjectForge. Separate basic issue/board contract from future Sprint planning and advanced projections.
title MVP ProjectForge simple board — advanced planning is separate
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 190
package "ProjectForge — separate system" {
 component "Issue / simple Kanban owner" as W
 interface "Create / update issue\nMove card / permitted query" as P
 interface "Current user / resource authority" as A
 database "ProjectForge-owned board / issue state\nDatabase mechanism undecided" as D
 W -- P
 W ..> A
 W --> D
}
rectangle "Core API adapter" as C
C ..> P : authenticated user-scoped API
rectangle "AFTER MVP\nProduct Backlog / task refinement\nSprint Goal / Sprint Backlog\nAdvanced reporting / automation" as F #F8EBD7
note bottom of W
 Simple board membership does not grant repository read/write authority.
end note
@enduml
